///                     rewrite. False -> skip_reason MUST be populated.
///   skip_reason    -- None when applied=True; non-empty String when
///                     applied=False (stub_ban / paper sec S3.p3.1).
///   timestamp_ms   -- emit time milliseconds since UNIX epoch.
